// Semantic layer for <YYYY>/<MM>  (Gate G4)
//
// This file IS the Technical evidence. Rubric A scores "DAX usage, data modelling" -
// we have no DAX, so the model must be legible and substantial in its own right.
// Treat it as a deliverable, not plumbing.
//
// Include the non-trivial measures: period-over-period, running totals,
// rank-within-group, share-of-parent, cohort retention.

source: dim_date is duckdb.table('../data/curated/dim_date.parquet') extend {
  primary_key: date
}

